  "decision": "SEC-hosted XML search excerpts establish that direct non-derivative US corporate common-equity short rows exist in multiple historical filing years. This materially advances Phase 191 from documentation-only to purposive row discovery. It does not establish prevalence, raw-file integrity, full-series deduplication, acceptance/first-receipt timing, historical listing identity, broad-universe coverage or predictive value. Next gate: retrieve and hash the complete raw XML and filing-index records for the stratified sample, parse all holdings deterministically, reconcile each accession to SEC-HEADER and the bulk dataset, then validate series/amendment/security identity. No returns or alpha test until these gates pass.",
